    "title": "Munzlinger rallies and advances; Paz falls in Round of 64 at 2026 U.S. Amateur",
    "text": "Columbia product Anson Munzlinger advanced to the Round of 32 in the 2026 U.S. Amateur on Wednesday after a 7 and 6 win against Tianyi Xiong from China. Xiong will play for Arizona next season.\nMunzlinger got to work early against Xiong, winning three of the first five holes of the match. Xiong birdied the sixth hole, which ended up being his only won hole of the match. Munzlinger went on to win holes 7,9, 10, 11 and 12 before the match came to a close.",
